              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAhabi wasesithi kuElija: Ungitholile yini, sitha sami? Wathi: “Ngikutholile, ngokuba uzithengise ukwenza okubi emehlweni kaJehova.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
