          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubonile yini ukuthi u-Ahabi uyazithoba phambi kwami? ngokuba ezithobile phambi kwami, angiyikuletha okubi emihleni yakhe; kodwa ezinsukwini zendodana yakhe ngizakwehlisela ububi phezu kwendlu yakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.29",
